<section class="patient-guide section-space" aria-labelledby="preparation-title">
 <div class="container">
  <div class="guide-heading" data-reveal><h2 id="preparation-title">A little preparation helps.</h2><p>Use your consultation to talk through your concerns and understand the next steps. These simple reminders can help you make the most of your visit.</p></div>
  <ul class="preparation-list" data-reveal="sequence">
   <li><h3>Call before you travel</h3><p>Confirm the timing and location by phone. The published hours are a guide; on-call duties may affect the doctor’s availability.</p></li>
   <li><h3>Keep your records together</h3><p>If you have previous prescriptions, reports or a current medication list, keep them together to discuss during your consultation.</p></li>
   <li><h3>Bring your questions</h3><p>Write down what you would like to understand, including questions about follow-up. Ask the clinic about any arrangements you need before visiting.</p></li>
  </ul>
 </div>
</section>
